{
  "document_path": "runtime/r0/prompt.md",
  "units": [
    {
      "unit_id": "u0001",
      "line_start": 1,
      "line_end": 1,
      "source_text": "# Chron-LLM R0 Specification\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0002",
      "line_start": 3,
      "line_end": 3,
      "source_text": "## Prompt Projection Layer\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0003",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 6,
      "source_text": "Version\n: R0\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0004",
      "line_start": 8,
      "line_end": 9,
      "source_text": "Status\n: Stable\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0005",
      "line_start": 11,
      "line_end": 12,
      "source_text": "Layer\n: Runtime Prompt Projection\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0006",
      "line_start": 14,
      "line_end": 14,
      "source_text": "Package\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0007",
      "line_start": 16,
      "line_end": 18,
      "source_text": "```\nchronos-r0.prompt\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0008",
      "line_start": 22,
      "line_end": 22,
      "source_text": "# 1. 目的\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0009",
      "line_start": 24,
      "line_end": 24,
      "source_text": "このモジュールは\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0010",
      "line_start": 26,
      "line_end": 30,
      "source_text": "```\nHistory\n    ↓\nPrompt\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0011",
      "line_start": 32,
      "line_end": 32,
      "source_text": "への唯一の変換器である。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0012",
      "line_start": 34,
      "line_end": 34,
      "source_text": "Chron-R0では\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0013",
      "line_start": 36,
      "line_end": 38,
      "source_text": "```\nHistory = Canonical Session\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0014",
      "line_start": 40,
      "line_end": 40,
      "source_text": "とみなし、\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0015",
      "line_start": 42,
      "line_end": 42,
      "source_text": "LLMへ入力するPromptを完全決定論で生成する。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0016",
      "line_start": 46,
      "line_end": 46,
      "source_text": "# 2. 責務\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0017",
      "line_start": 48,
      "line_end": 48,
      "source_text": "このモジュールが行うこと\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0018",
      "line_start": 50,
      "line_end": 55,
      "source_text": "* Historyの読み出し\n* Prompt構築\n* ChatML形式への射影\n* Roleの変換\n* Assistant開始位置の生成\n\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0019",
      "line_start": 58,
      "line_end": 58,
      "source_text": "行わないこと\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0020",
      "line_start": 60,
      "line_end": 68,
      "source_text": "* LLM実行\n* 履歴更新\n* Validation\n* Candidate生成\n* Commit\n* Policy\n* Retry\n* Worldline管理\n\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0021",
      "line_start": 71,
      "line_end": 71,
      "source_text": "# 3. 入力\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0022",
      "line_start": 73,
      "line_end": 75,
      "source_text": "```\nHistory\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0023",
      "line_start": 77,
      "line_end": 77,
      "source_text": "構造\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0024",
      "line_start": 79,
      "line_end": 85,
      "source_text": "```\nhistory\n ├ events[]\n      history-event\n          role\n          content\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0025",
      "line_start": 87,
      "line_end": 87,
      "source_text": "Role例\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0026",
      "line_start": 89,
      "line_end": 93,
      "source_text": "```\n:user\n:assistant\n:system\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0027",
      "line_start": 97,
      "line_end": 97,
      "source_text": "# 4. 出力\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0028",
      "line_start": 99,
      "line_end": 101,
      "source_text": "```\nString\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0029",
      "line_start": 103,
      "line_end": 103,
      "source_text": "LLMへ渡す完成Prompt。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0030",
      "line_start": 107,
      "line_end": 107,
      "source_text": "# 5. エントリポイント\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0031",
      "line_start": 109,
      "line_end": 111,
      "source_text": "```\nproject-to-prompt(history)\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0032",
      "line_start": 113,
      "line_end": 113,
      "source_text": "戻り値\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0033",
      "line_start": 115,
      "line_end": 117,
      "source_text": "```\nString\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0034",
      "line_start": 119,
      "line_end": 119,
      "source_text": "純粋関数である。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0035",
      "line_start": 121,
      "line_end": 121,
      "source_text": "Historyを書き換えない。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0036",
      "line_start": 125,
      "line_end": 125,
      "source_text": "# 6. Prompt生成アルゴリズム\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0037",
      "line_start": 127,
      "line_end": 127,
      "source_text": "## Step1\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0038",
      "line_start": 129,
      "line_end": 129,
      "source_text": "History取得\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0039",
      "line_start": 131,
      "line_end": 135,
      "source_text": "```\nevents\n←\nhistory-events(history)\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0040",
      "line_start": 139,
      "line_end": 139,
      "source_text": "## Step2\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0041",
      "line_start": 141,
      "line_end": 141,
      "source_text": "文字列生成開始\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0042",
      "line_start": 143,
      "line_end": 145,
      "source_text": "```\nwith-output-to-string\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0043",
      "line_start": 147,
      "line_end": 147,
      "source_text": "使用。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0044",
      "line_start": 149,
      "line_end": 149,
      "source_text": "副作用無し。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0045",
      "line_start": 153,
      "line_end": 153,
      "source_text": "## Step3\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0046",
      "line_start": 155,
      "line_end": 155,
      "source_text": "BOS追加\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0047",
      "line_start": 157,
      "line_end": 159,
      "source_text": "```\n<|begin_of_text|>\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0048",
      "line_start": 163,
      "line_end": 163,
      "source_text": "## Step4\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0049",
      "line_start": 165,
      "line_end": 165,
      "source_text": "System Header追加\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0050",
      "line_start": 167,
      "line_end": 169,
      "source_text": "```\n<|start_header_id|>system<|end_header_id|>\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0051",
      "line_start": 173,
      "line_end": 173,
      "source_text": "## Step5\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0052",
      "line_start": 175,
      "line_end": 175,
      "source_text": "固定System Prompt\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0053",
      "line_start": 177,
      "line_end": 179,
      "source_text": "```\nあなたは日本語で丁寧に答えるアシスタントです。\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0054",
      "line_start": 181,
      "line_end": 181,
      "source_text": "R0では固定値。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0055",
      "line_start": 185,
      "line_end": 185,
      "source_text": "## Step6\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0056",
      "line_start": 187,
      "line_end": 187,
      "source_text": "履歴列挙\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0057",
      "line_start": 189,
      "line_end": 192,
      "source_text": "```\nloop\nfor e across events\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0058",
      "line_start": 194,
      "line_end": 194,
      "source_text": "各イベントについて\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0059",
      "line_start": 196,
      "line_end": 206,
      "source_text": "```\nRole\n\n↓\n\nHeader\n\n↓\n\nContent\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0060",
      "line_start": 208,
      "line_end": 208,
      "source_text": "を追加する。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0061",
      "line_start": 212,
      "line_end": 212,
      "source_text": "生成形式\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0062",
      "line_start": 214,
      "line_end": 220,
      "source_text": "```\n<|start_header_id|>\nROLE\n<|end_header_id|>\n\nCONTENT\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0063",
      "line_start": 222,
      "line_end": 222,
      "source_text": "例\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0064",
      "line_start": 224,
      "line_end": 230,
      "source_text": "```\n<|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\nこんにちは\n\n<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\nこんにちは。\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0065",
      "line_start": 232,
      "line_end": 232,
      "source_text": "Role名は\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0066",
      "line_start": 234,
      "line_end": 236,
      "source_text": "```\n~(~A~)\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0067",
      "line_start": 238,
      "line_end": 238,
      "source_text": "により小文字化される。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0068",
      "line_start": 242,
      "line_end": 242,
      "source_text": "## Step7\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0069",
      "line_start": 244,
      "line_end": 244,
      "source_text": "最後にAssistant Header\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0070",
      "line_start": 246,
      "line_end": 248,
      "source_text": "```\n<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0071",
      "line_start": 250,
      "line_end": 250,
      "source_text": "のみ追加。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0072",
      "line_start": 252,
      "line_end": 252,
      "source_text": "ここから先をLLMが生成する。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0073",
      "line_start": 256,
      "line_end": 256,
      "source_text": "# 7. Promptフォーマット\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0074",
      "line_start": 258,
      "line_end": 258,
      "source_text": "最終形\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0075",
      "line_start": 260,
      "line_end": 276,
      "source_text": "```\n<|begin_of_text|>\n\n<|start_header_id|>system<|end_header_id|>\n\nSystem Prompt\n\n<|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n・・・\n\n<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n・・・\n\n<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0076",
      "line_start": 280,
      "line_end": 280,
      "source_text": "# 8. ChatML互換性\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0077",
      "line_start": 282,
      "line_end": 282,
      "source_text": "利用している特殊トークン\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0078",
      "line_start": 284,
      "line_end": 290,
      "source_text": "```\n<|begin_of_text|>\n\n<|start_header_id|>\n\n<|end_header_id|>\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0079",
      "line_start": 292,
      "line_end": 292,
      "source_text": "Llama3系Chat Template準拠。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0080",
      "line_start": 296,
      "line_end": 296,
      "source_text": "# 9. データフロー\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0081",
      "line_start": 298,
      "line_end": 320,
      "source_text": "```\nHistory\n\n↓\n\nhistory-events\n\n↓\n\nLoop\n\n↓\n\nRole Header\n\n↓\n\nContent\n\n↓\n\nPrompt String\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0082",
      "line_start": 324,
      "line_end": 324,
      "source_text": "# 10. 決定性\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0083",
      "line_start": 326,
      "line_end": 326,
      "source_text": "同一Historyなら\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0084",
      "line_start": 328,
      "line_end": 330,
      "source_text": "```\nPrompt\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0085",
      "line_start": 332,
      "line_end": 332,
      "source_text": "は必ず一致する。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0086",
      "line_start": 334,
      "line_end": 334,
      "source_text": "つまり\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0087",
      "line_start": 336,
      "line_end": 342,
      "source_text": "```\nPrompt(H)\n\n=\n\nPrompt(H)\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0088",
      "line_start": 344,
      "line_end": 344,
      "source_text": "乱数\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0089",
      "line_start": 346,
      "line_end": 346,
      "source_text": "無し。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0090",
      "line_start": 348,
      "line_end": 348,
      "source_text": "時刻\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0091",
      "line_start": 350,
      "line_end": 350,
      "source_text": "無し。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0092",
      "line_start": 352,
      "line_end": 352,
      "source_text": "環境依存\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0093",
      "line_start": 354,
      "line_end": 354,
      "source_text": "無し。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0094",
      "line_start": 358,
      "line_end": 358,
      "source_text": "# 11. 不変条件\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0095",
      "line_start": 360,
      "line_end": 360,
      "source_text": "Historyは変更しない。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0096",
      "line_start": 362,
      "line_end": 364,
      "source_text": "```\nInput Immutable\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0097",
      "line_start": 366,
      "line_end": 366,
      "source_text": "Promptのみ生成。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0098",
      "line_start": 368,
      "line_end": 370,
      "source_text": "```\nOutput Only\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0099",
      "line_start": 374,
      "line_end": 374,
      "source_text": "# 12. 時間計算量\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0100",
      "line_start": 376,
      "line_end": 376,
      "source_text": "イベント数\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0101",
      "line_start": 378,
      "line_end": 380,
      "source_text": "```\nN\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0102",
      "line_start": 382,
      "line_end": 382,
      "source_text": "文字列長\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0103",
      "line_start": 384,
      "line_end": 386,
      "source_text": "```\nL\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0104",
      "line_start": 388,
      "line_end": 388,
      "source_text": "計算量\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0105",
      "line_start": 390,
      "line_end": 392,
      "source_text": "```\nO(N+L)\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0106",
      "line_start": 396,
      "line_end": 396,
      "source_text": "# 13. メモリ使用量\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0107",
      "line_start": 398,
      "line_end": 398,
      "source_text": "生成文字列のみ。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0108",
      "line_start": 400,
      "line_end": 400,
      "source_text": "追加メモリ\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0109",
      "line_start": 402,
      "line_end": 404,
      "source_text": "```\nO(L)\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0110",
      "line_start": 408,
      "line_end": 408,
      "source_text": "# 14. エラー処理\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0111",
      "line_start": 410,
      "line_end": 410,
      "source_text": "このモジュール自身では\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0112",
      "line_start": 412,
      "line_end": 414,
      "source_text": "```\nerror\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0113",
      "line_start": 416,
      "line_end": 416,
      "source_text": "を発生させない。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0114",
      "line_start": 418,
      "line_end": 418,
      "source_text": "History構造が正しい前提。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0115",
      "line_start": 422,
      "line_end": 422,
      "source_text": "# 15. モジュール依存\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0116",
      "line_start": 424,
      "line_end": 424,
      "source_text": "依存\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0117",
      "line_start": 426,
      "line_end": 428,
      "source_text": "```\nchronos-r0.history\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0118",
      "line_start": 430,
      "line_end": 430,
      "source_text": "利用API\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0119",
      "line_start": 432,
      "line_end": 438,
      "source_text": "```\nhistory-events\n\nhistory-event-role\n\nhistory-event-content\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0120",
      "line_start": 440,
      "line_end": 440,
      "source_text": "LLM依存\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0121",
      "line_start": 442,
      "line_end": 442,
      "source_text": "無し。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0122",
      "line_start": 446,
      "line_end": 446,
      "source_text": "# 16. レイヤ境界\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0123",
      "line_start": 448,
      "line_end": 448,
      "source_text": "入力\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0124",
      "line_start": 450,
      "line_end": 452,
      "source_text": "```\nHistory\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0125",
      "line_start": 456,
      "line_end": 456,
      "source_text": "このモジュール\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0126",
      "line_start": 460,
      "line_end": 462,
      "source_text": "```\nPrompt\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0127",
      "line_start": 466,
      "line_end": 468,
      "source_text": "```\nchronos-r0.llama\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0128",
      "line_start": 472,
      "line_end": 472,
      "source_text": "# 17. 設計原則\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0129",
      "line_start": 474,
      "line_end": 474,
      "source_text": "## Projection Only\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0130",
      "line_start": 476,
      "line_end": 476,
      "source_text": "意味解析しない。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0131",
      "line_start": 480,
      "line_end": 480,
      "source_text": "Validationしない。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0132",
      "line_start": 484,
      "line_end": 484,
      "source_text": "Historyを書き換えない。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0133",
      "line_start": 488,
      "line_end": 488,
      "source_text": "Promptのみ生成する。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0134",
      "line_start": 492,
      "line_end": 492,
      "source_text": "# 18. R0における位置付け\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0135",
      "line_start": 494,
      "line_end": 509,
      "source_text": "```\nHistory\n\n↓\n\nPrompt Projection\n      ← 本モジュール\n\n↓\n\nLLM Runtime\n\n↓\n\nRaw Text\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0136",
      "line_start": 513,
      "line_end": 513,
      "source_text": "# 19. 将来拡張点\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0137",
      "line_start": 515,
      "line_end": 515,
      "source_text": "R1以降では固定System Promptを設定から取得する構成へ変更可能。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0138",
      "line_start": 517,
      "line_end": 517,
      "source_text": "想定される拡張例:\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0139",
      "line_start": 519,
      "line_end": 523,
      "source_text": "* `config` によるシステムプロンプト切り替え\n* 要約 (`summary`) の挿入\n* 長期メモリ (`memory`) セクションの追加\n* コンテキスト長に応じた履歴トリミング\n* モデルごとのテンプレート切り替え（Llama 3系、Qwen系、Gemma系など）\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0140",
      "line_start": 525,
      "line_end": 525,
      "source_text": "これらは **Projection Policy** の拡張であり、本モジュールの「History→Promptを決定論的に射影する」という責務自体は維持される。\n"
    }
  ]
}
